    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot the line, roll with the flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ballest of Them All is a <strong>precision-platforming time-attack game</strong> where a perfectly weighted physics ball and a tiny hop is your entire move-set. Carve through speed lanes, thread technical sequences, and shave milliseconds off your PB to climb global leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/a8a05c4ed31a67690d4a14240bc5cb54.poster.avif?t=1752586301\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/a8a05c4ed31a67690d4a14240bc5cb54.webm?t=1752586301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/a8a05c4ed31a67690d4a14240bc5cb54.mp4?t=1752586301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;ONE MORE RUN&quot;</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Route discovery</strong> \u2013 every track hides risk-reward shortcuts and advanced tech. Chase the top ghosts or discover your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple control<i>s</i></strong><i> \u2013</i> roll, hop, and surf with one button and a stick; mastery is in  subtle control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant restarts</strong> \u2013 Bad timing? Hit R and you\u2019re rolling again in under a second.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medals &amp; global ranks</strong> \u2013 Get gold, beat the map author, then compete for the top spot on global leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay ghosts</strong> \u2013race friends, world records, or your own PB.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/a9a15522915612b161a45f164322984f.poster.avif?t=1752586301\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/a9a15522915612b161a45f164322984f.webm?t=1752586301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/a9a15522915612b161a45f164322984f.mp4?t=1752586301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TWO MODES</strong>\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CIRCUIT\u00a0</strong>\u2013 20 bite-sized tracks that test your line-hunting and PB-grinding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRIALS</strong> \u2013 Test your technique in The Tower, an endurance climbing challenge built for extreme ballers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/f3ca26df5e5c208c1a8721cfad1b9128.poster.avif?t=1752586301\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/f3ca26df5e5c208c1a8721cfad1b9128.webm?t=1752586301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/f3ca26df5e5c208c1a8721cfad1b9128.mp4?t=1752586301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEMO AVAILABLE NOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your ball and roll into the first 8 tracks of the Circuit today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/82ccfd16e031baff2a7606ad5cd192c6.poster.avif?t=1752586301\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/82ccfd16e031baff2a7606ad5cd192c6.webm?t=1752586301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/82ccfd16e031baff2a7606ad5cd192c6.mp4?t=1752586301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note from the developer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ballest is built by a tiny team that grew up on games like Trials, Trackmania, and Super Monkey Ball. We wanted to capture the magic of a game that's simple on the surface but full of possibility. If you decide to check it out, I hope you feel that magic.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot the line, roll with the flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ballest of Them All is a <strong>precision-platforming time-attack game</strong> where a perfectly weighted physics ball and a tiny hop is your entire move-set. Carve through speed lanes, thread technical sequences, and shave milliseconds off your PB to climb global leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/a8a05c4ed31a67690d4a14240bc5cb54.poster.avif?t=1752586301\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/a8a05c4ed31a67690d4a14240bc5cb54.webm?t=1752586301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/a8a05c4ed31a67690d4a14240bc5cb54.mp4?t=1752586301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;ONE MORE RUN&quot;</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Route discovery</strong> \u2013 every track hides risk-reward shortcuts and advanced tech. Chase the top ghosts or discover your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple control<i>s</i></strong><i> \u2013</i> roll, hop, and surf with one button and a stick; mastery is in  subtle control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant restarts</strong> \u2013 Bad timing? Hit R and you\u2019re rolling again in under a second.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medals &amp; global ranks</strong> \u2013 Get gold, beat the map author, then compete for the top spot on global leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay ghosts</strong> \u2013race friends, world records, or your own PB.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><spa