/apps/3339810/extras/82ccfd16e031baff2a7606ad5cd192c6.poster.avif?t=1752586301\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/82ccfd16e031baff2a7606ad5cd192c6.webm?t=1752586301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/82ccfd16e031baff2a7606ad5cd192c6.mp4?t=1752586301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note from the developer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ballest is built by a tiny team that grew up on games like Trials, Trackmania, and Super Monkey Ball. We wanted to capture the magic of a game that's simple on the surface but full of possibility. If you decide to check it out, I hope you feel that magic.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
